  <ButtonText>k__BackingField: "C\u2019est toi le responsable, tu dois pr\xE9senter
    tes excuses."
  <NpcText>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 292bca25009c3b846973697c392c826a, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3973df86522e4b743879172e3518e737, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Vous pensez ? J\u2019ai p't'\xEAtre eu tort alors, j\u2019vais aller m\u2019excuser. "
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 292bca25009c3b846973697c392c826a, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Mais j\u2019manquerais pas d\u2019lui rappeler d\u2019se calmer."
